    "short_description_70": "AI-powered LinkedIn carousel and newsletter workspace with review-first publishing.",
    "short_description_200": "BrandOps is a review-first content workspace that turns one research topic into a LinkedIn carousel and a cited newsletter. Built for solo operators, founders, coaches, trainers, and consultants who want consistent personal brand content without losing control. AI researches, writes, and designs; humans approve every publish action.",
